    "title": "North Canaan reckons with Town Hall turmoil: Breaking down the timeline - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Patrick L. Sullivan ,\n14 hours ago NORTH CANAAN — The following is a timeline of events involving the North Canaan Town Clerk, Jean Jacquier. This timeline relies on public records and previous Lakeville Journal reporting. November 2023: Brian Ohler (R) is elected First Selectman. Jacquier (R) is elected to her fourth term as Town Clerk. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
